From e986e4993e9d6e08ac4e9ecb5221fa37475f7d1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Priyanka Gujjula <pgujjula@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 17:53:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] pta: qcom: pas: nord: update IRIS video-codec bring-up

Update the Nord IRIS video port with the correct bring-up sequence
from the TZ reference driver. Switch the non-secure non-pixel region
from SEC_2 to SEC_5, split threshold writes into a dedicated helper,
remove the iris_resumed software state variable (running state is read
directly from XTSS_SW_RESET), and define memory region bounds as
explicit start/size constants with consistent (uint32_t) casts.

Signed-off-by: Priyanka Gujjula <pgujjula@qti.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
